	<#f4cf72>IBUKI — SFIII 3rd STRIKE</>
	<#aab8c7>Moves & Controls</>

<#72c8eb>BUTTONS</>
Light Punch		^X
Medium Punch		^Y
Heavy Punch		^Z
Light Kick		^A
Medium Kick		^B
Heavy Kick		^C
<#aab8c7>Directions are relative to your opponent.</>
<#aab8c7>A plus sign means simultaneous input.</>

<#72c8eb>BASIC ACTIONS</>
Forward / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B
High Jump		_D_U
Quick Stand		_D
<#aab8c7>Tap Down as you land after a knockdown.</>
High / Air Parry		_F
Low Parry		_D
<#aab8c7>Tap just before the attack connects.</>
Personal Action		^Z_+^C / ^S
<#aab8c7>When the taunt hits, your next attack gains damage.</>
Leap Attack		^Y_+^B

<#72c8eb>THROWS</>
Yami Kazura		^X_+^A
<#aab8c7>Close to opponent; Forward / Back changes throw.</>
Tobizaru (air)		^X_+^A
<#aab8c7>Close to an airborne opponent.</>

<#72c8eb>COMMAND NORMALS</>
Maki Geri		_F_+^A
Agemen		_B_+^Y
Ura Maki Geri		_B_+^B
Zudaki		_F_+^B
Sazan		_DF_+^B
Oitsui Uraken		^Z during far Heavy Punch
Bonsho Geri		_F_+^C

<#72c8eb>TARGET COMBOS</>
Diagonal Jump		^X, _F_+^Z
Diagonal Jump		^A, _F_+^Y
Air Combo		^Z, _F_+^B
Ground Combo		_B_+^B, _F_+^B
Far Combo		^X, ^Y, _F_+^A
Close Combo		^X, ^Y, ^Z
<#aab8c7>Cancel Medium Punch on its first hit.</>
Ground Combo		^A, ^B, ^C
<#aab8c7>Finish with far Heavy Kick.</>
Close Combo		^Z, _D_+^C, ^C
<#aab8c7>Let close Heavy Punch hit twice first.</>
Close Combo		^X, ^Y, _D_+^C, ^C

<#72c8eb>EX MOVES — HOW TO USE</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves are powered-up versions of certain specials.</>
<#aab8c7>Use the normal motion, then press two buttons together.</>
Two Punch buttons		[^X_+^Y/^Y_+^Z/^X_+^Z]
Two Kick buttons		[^A_+^B/^B_+^C/^A_+^C]
<#aab8c7>Use the button type required by that move.</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves spend power; build meter before using them.</>
<#aab8c7>EX specials require 400 power.</>

<#72c8eb>SPECIAL MOVES</>
Kunai (air)		_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Reverse Kunai (air)		_D_DB_B_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Kubiori		_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Kazekiri		_F_D_DF_+[^A/^B/^C]
Tsumuji		_D_DB_B_+[^A/^B/^C]
Tsumuji Follow-up		[^A/^B/^C]
Tsumuji Low Follow-up		_D_+[^A/^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>Press during Tsumuji.</>
Hien		_B_D_DB_+[^A/^B/^C]
Raida		_F_DF_D_DB_B_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Tsuijigoe		_F_D_DF_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Kasumi Gake		_D_DF_F_+[^A/^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>After Hien connects: Kunai or Kasumi Suzaku.</>
<#aab8c7>After Tsuijigoe's apex: Kunai or Kasumi Suzaku.</>

<#72c8eb>EX MOVES — 400 POWER</>
<#aab8c7>Use any two Punches or any two Kicks.</>
EX Kunai (air)		_D_DF_F_+[^X_+^Y/^Y_+^Z/^X_+^Z]
Reverse EX Kunai (air)		_D_DB_B_+[^X_+^Y/^Y_+^Z/^X_+^Z]
EX Kubiori		_D_DF_F_+[^X_+^Y/^Y_+^Z/^X_+^Z]
EX Kazekiri		_F_D_DF_+[^A_+^B/^B_+^C/^A_+^C]
EX Tsumuji		_D_DB_B_+[^A_+^B/^B_+^C/^A_+^C]
EX Hien		_B_D_DB_+[^A_+^B/^B_+^C/^A_+^C]
<#aab8c7>Hold Forward after EX Kunai for extra range.</>
<#aab8c7>EX Kazekiri: air attacks on descent after a hit.</>

<#72c8eb>SUPER ART SELECTION</>
<#aab8c7>During intro: Up / Down, then any attack to confirm.</>
<#aab8c7>Default selection: ALL Super Arts.</>
<#aab8c7>Super commands below finish on Down-Forward.</>

<#72c8eb>SELECTED SUPER ART — ONE STOCK</>
I: Kasumi Suzaku (air)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>880 power; mash Punch for additional Kunai.</>
II: Yoroi Doshi		_D_DF_F_D_DF_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>1200 power; perform on the ground.</>
III: Yami Shigure		_D_DF_F_D_DF_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>800 power; perform on the ground.</>

<#72c8eb>ALL SUPER ARTS — 1280 POWER EACH</>
Kasumi Suzaku (air)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Reverse Suzaku (air)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Yoroi Doshi		_D_DF_F_D_DF_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Yami Shigure		_D_DF_F_D_DF_+[^A/^B/^C]
Hashinsho		_D_DB_B_D_DB_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>Hashinsho is enabled in this build's ALL mode.</>
<#aab8c7>Reverse Suzaku also works with Art I selected.</>
